PLAUD direct-PC research

The Android integration builds on examples from Plaud-AI/plaud-sdk-public,
licensed under Apache License 2.0. The vendor SDK AAR is obtained separately
from that upstream project and is not included in this distribution.

Protocol comparisons refer to Kurikara-dev/plaud-note-nb100-re and official
PLAUD Embedded documentation. The firmware research scripts and notes analyze
an owner-supplied firmware file; no PLAUD firmware binary or decompiled vendor
source is distributed here.
